  "history": [
    {
      "date": "2026-02-23",
      "description": "Added the level 4 Spell Tower, the Earthquake Spell Tower. Spell Tower4 Earthquake"
    }
  ],
  "facts": [
    "The Spell Tower is a defensive building unlocked at Town Hall level 15. As opposed to the conventional defensive structures, the Spell Tower does not shoot projectiles at enemies; instead, it activates a spell - similar to ones players use for offense - into its surrounding radius.",
    "At level 2, the Spell Tower can be set to launch Poison Spells. When an attacking unit comes into range of the tower in this mode, the Spell Tower will launch a poison bomb at that unit, creating an area that does moderate damage over time and that slows down attacking troops.",
    "Defending Heroes are affected, but they only gain half of the damage and speed increase (+30% damage and +15 speed), similar to how they are less affected by buffing spells when used on attack."
  ],
